# Constrained SFTP backup-host setup contract.
# S2 implements the actual account, sshd, and filesystem provisioning.
# Client enrollment is intentionally deferred to S3.
#
# Parameters:
# --name           service/account name; default: sftp
# --root           controlled backup root; default: /srv/gway-sftp
# --user           upload account; default: gway-sftp
# --group          upload group; default: gway-sftp
# --port           SSH/SFTP port; default: 22
# --destination    optional per-client destination/path
